<title>FRANCE: Rhone-Poulenc a 'speculative buy'- broker.</title>
<headline>Rhone-Poulenc a 'speculative buy'- broker.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Broker Leven said on Wednesday it had issued a &quot;speculative buy&quot; advice on Rhone-Poulenc where it previously was &quot;neutral.&quot;</p>
<p>Leven said that the company's debt remained a worry but it welcomed developments in the company's drugs division and mentioned rumours of a demerger.</p>
<p>At 0940 GMT, the shares were down 1.26 percent at 32.80 in a market 0.57 percent lower.</p>
</text>
